pulls/124152","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124152","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124152.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124152.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-06T00:19:23Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124131\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- `[codeblock]` sets `in_codeblock_tag`, but `[gdscript]` inside `[codeblocks]` only sets `in_codeblocks_gdscript_tag`. The block that processes regular description text only checked `in_codeblock_tag`, so code lines in `[codeblocks]` were processed like description text and lost their indentation. I added `in_codeblocks_gdscript_tag` to the condition of that block.\r\n- The existing `[codeblocks]` test only had a single unindented line, so it didn't catch this bug. I added a test with indentation and brackets. It fails before the fix and passes after.\r\n<img width=\"839\" height=\"446\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c1eb47a-2473-4d1a-a7b0-49b3d40efbe7\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reac